  "title": "Asymptotic Distribution of Form of Polyhedra",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Problem Consider the set of all topologically inequivalent polyhedra with $k$ edges. Define a form parameter for a polyhedron as $\\beta:= v/(k+2)$ where $v$ is the number of vertices. What is the distribution of $\\beta$ for $k \\to \\infty$?",
